  "statement": "Define a sequence \\(\\left\\{a_{n}\\right\\}\\) by \\(a_{1}=1\\) and \\(a_{n}=\\left(a_{n-1}\\right)!+1\\) for every \\(n>1\\). Find the least \\(n\\) for which \\(a_{n}>10^{10}\\).",
  "answerChoices": [],
  "answer": {
